Embedded fonts in templates/fonts.css are subsets of:

- Clash Grotesk by Indian Type Foundry, distributed via Fontshare under its free license
  (https://fonts.fontshare.com). The license permits embedding and redistribution,
  including as base64 data URIs. See https://fonts.fontshare.com/license for terms.

Subsets cover Latin, Latin-1 Supplement, punctuation, and typographic symbols, so the
single-file deliverable keeps its typography while opening fully offline.
